rust	UNKNOWN STEP	- CI `test (shard 1/4)` is red on `sim::the_hunt_finds_a_planted_bug_sooner_than_random_seeds_and_minimises_it` (crates/cli/tests/sim/main.rs:291): the same test fails on staging's own CI at c3d24d5d, this PR's base; it does not touch the page.
